---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" signup={false}>
  <article class="narrow pv">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>If you sign up for the ebook, we keep your first name and email address so we can send you the ebook and a weekly letter with new stories. We don't sell or share your details. Every email has a link to unsubscribe, and you can ask us to delete your details at any time.</p>
    <p>This site doesn't use advertising trackers.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
<style>.pv { padding: 3rem 1.25rem; }</style>
